{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12877","headline":"送丹阳刘太真 · 韩翃","name":"送丹阳刘太真","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长干道上落花朝，羡尔当年赏事饶。\n下筯已怜鹅炙美，开笼不奈鸭媒娇。\n春衣晚入青杨巷，细马初过皂荚桥。\n相访不辞千里远，西风好借木兰桡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}